    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9gw",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gv",
          "text": "Our Aurora product liability attorneys will promptly return your phone calls, texts, and emails as well as keep you updated on the status of your case. To find out more about our unique services and tailored representation, reach out to us in Aurora today.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9gy",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gx",
          "text": "What is a Defective or Dangerous Product?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9h0",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gz",
          "text": "Consumer products that cause injury while used for their proper or intended purpose are defective or dangerous. These products are subject to product liability claims. Product liability is an area of personal injury law.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9h2",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9h1",
          "text": "As consumers, most people know of products already part of safety recalls and product liability lawsuits. Common product liability lawsuits include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9h4",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9h3",
          "text": "Vehicle airbags, brakes, fuel tanks, and ignition systems",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9h6",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9h5",
          "text": "Children’s beds, car seats, cribs, pajamas, strollers, and toys",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9h8",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9h7",
          "text": "Construction and building products such as ladders, scaffolding, and power tools",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9ha",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9h9",
          "text": "Household electrics and appliances like ranges, ovens, lamps, heaters, carbon monoxide detectors, lawnmowers, and grills",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9hc",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hb",
          "text": "Medical devices and implants including artificial hips, knee implants, surgical mesh, and pain pumps",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9he",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hd",
          "text": "Pharmaceuticals, both over the counter and prescription drugs",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9hg",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hf",
          "text": "There are many more consumer products on recall lists and currently under investigation. Contact an experienced product liability lawyer for advice on any of these or another dangerous or defective consumer product.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9hi",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hh",
          "text": "Colorado Product Liability Laws",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9hn",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l9hk",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.courts.state.co.us/userfiles/file/Court_Probation/Supreme_Court/Committees/Civil_Jury_Instructions_Committee/Chapter%2014.pdf"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hj",
          "text": "Colorado has ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hl",
          "text": "strict product liability laws",
          "marks": [
            "l9hk"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hm",
          "text": " and expects manufacturers and retailers to place safe, working products into the marketplace. When corporations fail to do so, Colorado allows injured consumers to recover from their injuries.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9hp",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ho",
          "text": "Compensation in a Colorado product liability claim rests on proving the following:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9hr",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hq",
          "text": "The at-fault party designed, manufactured, or sold the product",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9ht",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hs",
          "text": "The product was defective when it left the at-fault party’s possession",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9hv",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hu",
          "text": "The consumer used the product for its intended purpose",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9hx",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hw",
          "text": "The consumer suffered harm due to the defect",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9i2",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l9hz",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.lpdirect.net/casb/crs/13-80-102.html"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hy",
          "text": "The at-fault party is liable when a consumer uses the product in any foreseeable way. There is a ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9i0",
          "text": "two-year time limit",
          "marks": [
            "l9hz"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9i1",
          "text": " or statute of limitations to file a product liability claim in Colorado. If a consumer fails to meet this deadline, they may lose any right to recover.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9i4",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9i3",
          "text": "Seek Justice for Your Injury – Contact an Aurora Product Liability Attorney",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9i9",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l9i6",
          "_type": "link",
